<title>JAPAN: JAL applies for shelf registration.</title>
<headline>JAL applies for shelf registration.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan Airlines Co Ltd (JAL) said on Wednesday that it had applied to the Finance Ministry for a shelf registration to issue up to 300 billion yen worth of corporate bonds.</p>
<p>The registration will be effective for two years from April 8, it said.</p>
